  Slug: discarded-fleshwarp
  DisplayName: Discarded Fleshwarp
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/heritage.svg
  Description: "The biomancers and mutagenists who warped your form labeled you a
    \"discard on discovery\"\u2014a euphemism for destroying you on sight. An anomaly
    among anomalies, your body stubbornly repudiates the efforts of fleshcrafters
    seeking to mold you to their grandiose visions, and your immune responses blunt
    the worst effects of unwanted fleshwarping attempts. If you roll a success on
    a saving throw against a transmutation effect, you get a critical success instead."
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Lost Omens Impossible Lands
